#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: wp-woocommerce-store-balance.php:4
msgid "WooCommerce Store Balance"
msgstr "WooCommerce Store Balance"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: wp-woocommerce-store-balance.php:5
msgid "https://github.com/generoi/wp-woocommerce-store-balance"
msgstr "https://github.com/generoi/wp-woocommerce-store-balance"

#. Description of the plugin
#: wp-woocommerce-store-balance.php:6
msgid ""
"Gift cards and store credit for WooCommerce: one balance engine, spent after "
"tax like a payment, locked to its currency."
msgstr ""
"Geschenkkarten und Shop-Guthaben für WooCommerce: eine gemeinsame "
"Guthabenverwaltung, die nach Steuern wie eine Zahlung verrechnet wird und an "
"ihre Währung gebunden ist."

